          {
            "title": "Last item",
            "id": 96223,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Python, liste gibi indekslenebilir bir nesnenin sonundan değerleri almak için <strong>negatif indeksleme</strong> kullanmamıza izin verir.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"scores = [\" /><text value=\"4.5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3.5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"latest = scores[\" /><text value=\"-1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(latest)\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"57\" /><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"64\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>print</code>, ardından <code>latest</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Explained",
            "id": 97110,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Negatif indeksleme, bir listedeki öğeyi en sağ taraftan aldığımız anlamına gelir. Negatif indeksi belirtmek için <code>-</code> sembolünü kullanırız.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"users = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Tony&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Tina&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Tom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"last = users[\" /><text value=\"-1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(last)\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"59\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Tom\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>print</code>, ardından <code>last</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Negatif indeksleme, bir öğeyi listenin en sağ tarafından alır.</p><p>Negatif bir indeksi belirtmek için <code>-</code> sembolünü kullanırız.</p><p>Negatif indeks kullanarak <strong>son</strong> kullanıcıyı <code>last</code> içinde depola, ardından <code>last</code> değerini yazdır.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"users = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Tony&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Tina&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Tom&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"last = users[\" /><text value=\"-1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(last)\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"47\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"users\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Tom\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>1</code>, ardından <code>last</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Item position",
            "id": 96224,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Listenin uzunluğuna kadar olan ve uzunluğun kendisini de içeren herhangi bir negatif değer kullanabiliriz; bu, ilk değeri getirir.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"ratings = [\" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(ratings[\" /><text value=\"-6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"])\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"45\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>-</code>, ardından <code>6</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Listenin uzunluğuna kadar olan ve uzunluğu da içeren herhangi bir negatif değeri kullanabiliriz. Bu, ilk değeri getirir.</p><p>Listede <code>6</code> puan var. En baştaki <strong>ilk</strong> puana ulaşan negatif bir indeks kullan.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"ratings = [\" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(ratings[\" /><text value=\"-6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"])\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"5\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>-</code>, ardından <code>6</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Modifying list items",
            "id": 96225,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Belirtilen konumdaki liste öğelerini de değiştirebiliriz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"users = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Jack&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ahmed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Elaine&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"users[\" /><text value=\"-3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jill&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(users)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"44\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['Jill', 'Ahmed', 'Elaine']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>-</code>, ardından <code>3</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Negatif indeks kullanarak <strong>ilk</strong> kullanıcıyı <code>\"Jill\"</code> ile değiştir.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"users = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Jack&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Ahmed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Elaine&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"users[\" /><text value=\"-3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jill&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(users)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"1\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['Jill', 'Ahmed', 'Elaine']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>-</code>, ardından <code>3</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Tuples",
            "id": 96226,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tuple'lar da sıralı veri yapılarıdır ve değerler alınabilir, ancak <strong>değişmezdir</strong> ve bu nedenle değiştirilemez.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"info = (\" /><text value=\"&quot;Graz&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Austria&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Europe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;World&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"info[\" /><text value=\"-4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"] = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Vienna&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"TypeError: 'tuple' object does not support item assignment\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Out of range error",
            "id": 96227,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Nesnenin aralığı dışındaki bir konumda bulunan değeri almaya çalışırsak bir hatayla karşılaşırız.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"results = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Win&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Loss&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Draw&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"results[\" /><text value=\"-5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"44\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"IndexError: list index out of range\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>-</code>, ardından <code>5</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Listede yalnızca <code>3</code> öğe var. Negatif bir değerle başlangıcın ötesini indeksle ve <code>IndexError: list index out of range</code> oluştur.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"results = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;Win&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Loss&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Draw&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"results[\" /><text value=\"-5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"3\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"IndexError: list index out of range\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>-</code>, ardından <code>5</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "`del` keyword",
            "id": 96228,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>del</code> anahtar sözcüğü, nesneleri veya bir veri yapısındaki öğeleri silmemizi sağlar.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"winners = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;John&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Helen&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Sigmund&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Olaf&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"del\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" winners[\" /><text value=\"-1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(winners)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"50\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"['John', 'Helen', 'Sigmund']\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>del</code> ifadesini yazdığından emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "`del` objects",
            "id": 96230,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>del</code>, sözlükler, listeler ve kümeler gibi veri yapıları da dahil olmak üzere herhangi bir nesneyi silmek için kullanılabilir.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"letters = {\" /><text value=\"'a'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"'b'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"'c'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"del\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" letters\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(letters)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"44\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"NameError: name 'letters' is not defined\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>print</code>, ardından <code>(</code> ve sonra <code>letters</code>, <code>)</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>del</code> anahtar sözcüğü, liste, sözlük veya küme tutanlar dahil olmak üzere bir değişkeni siler.</p><p>Sildikten sonra <code>NameError</code> oluşturmak için değişkeni yazdırmayı dene.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"letters = {\" /><text value=\"'a'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"'b'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"'c'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"del\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" letters\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(letters)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;letters&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"NameError: name 'letters' is not defined\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>print</code>, ardından <code>(</code>, <code>letters</code> ve son olarak <code>)</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "`del` on dictionary",
            "id": 96231,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>İstenmeyen <code>key:value</code> çiftlerini sözlükten kaldırmak için sözlükteki bir anahtarla <code>del</code> kullanabiliriz.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"product = {\" /><text value=\"'category'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"'book'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"           \" /><text value=\"'price'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"4.99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"           \" /><text value=\"'in_shop'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"del\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" product[\" /><text value=\"'in_shop'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(product)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"97\" /><option startIndex=\"97\" endIndex=\"98\" /><option startIndex=\"107\" endIndex=\"108\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"del\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{'category': 'book', 'price': 4.99}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>product</code>, ardından <code>[</code> ve son olarak <code>]</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>İstenmeyen bir anahtar-değer çiftini kaldırmak için sözlükteki bir anahtarla <code>del</code> kullanabiliriz.</p><p><code>product</code> içindeki <code>\"in_shop\"</code> anahtar-değer çiftini kaldırmak için <code>del</code> kullan.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"product = {\" /><text value=\"'category'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"'book'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"           \" /><text value=\"'price'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"4.99\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"           \" /><text value=\"'in_shop'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"del\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" product[\" /><text value=\"'in_shop'\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(product)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"90\" endIndex=\"97\" /><option startIndex=\"97\" endIndex=\"98\" /><option startIndex=\"98\" endIndex=\"107\" /><option startIndex=\"107\" endIndex=\"108\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"'price'\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"del\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"{'category': 'book', 'price': 4.99}\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>product</code>, ardından <code>[</code>, <code>'in_shop'</code> ve son olarak <code>]</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: indexing",
            "id": 96238,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bir liste öğesini alırken hangi dizin değerlerini kullanabiliriz?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Listenin aralığındaki pozitif veya negatif değerler</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Python yalnızca pozitif değerlerin kullanılmasına izin verir</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Listenin aralığındaki pozitif veya negatif değerler.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Liste öğeleri, listenin aralığındaki pozitif veya negatif indeks değerleriyle alınabilir.</p><p>Bir listede dört öğe var. Hangi indeksleme planı hatasız olarak bir öğe getirir?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Başlangıçtan <code>2</code> veya sondan <code>-2</code> kullanmak</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Python negatif indeksleri reddettiği için yalnızca pozitif değerleri kullanmak</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Dördüncü öğeyi ifade ettiği için <code>4</code> kullanmak</item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\">Negatif indeksler aralık dışında kalamadığı için herhangi bir negatif değer kullanmak</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Başlangıçtan <code>2</code> veya sondan <code>-2</code> kullanmak.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: indexing",
            "id": 96239,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mesajda kullanmak üzere demet içerisindeki ilk ve son değeri al.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"user = (\" /><text value=\"&quot;Joe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Paris&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"27\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"name = user[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"age = user[\" /><text value=\"-1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"message = \" /><text value=\"f&quot;\" /><text value=\"{name}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{age}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(message)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"age\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Joe 27\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>user</code>, ardından <code>0</code> ve sonra <code>user</code>, <code>-</code>, <code>1</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mesaj için demetteki <strong>ilk</strong> ve <strong>son</strong> değeri al.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"user = (\" /><text value=\"&quot;Joe&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;Paris&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"27\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"name = user[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"age = user[\" /><text value=\"-1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"message = \" /><text value=\"f&quot;\" /><text value=\"{name}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{age}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"&quot;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(message)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"35\" endIndex=\"39\" /><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"age\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Joe 27\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Önce <code>user</code>, ardından <code>0</code>, <code>user</code>, <code>-</code> ve son olarak <code>1</code> öğelerini seçtiğinden emin ol.</p></body></html>"
          },
